  <section class="b-body-copy" data-label="block-body-copy">
    <div class="wrapper -md">
      <div class="wysiwyg">
        <p><strong>425 Grand Concourse</strong> is a 26-story, 277-unit mixed-use, mixed-income project located in the Mott Haven neighborhood of the Bronx. A premier example of sustainable design, the project currently stands as the largest Passive House-certified multifamily development in North America and will consume 70% less energy than a conventional housing project. The project units are affordable to households at a wide range of incomes (from below 30% to 130% of AMI), with 28 units designated for formerly homeless households. All 276 residential units (excluding the super’s unit) are income-restricted, with 193 units deemed permanently affordable under NYC regulatory requirements.</p>
<p>The project’s design and finishes showcase an attention to detail comparable to luxury market-rate developments – with resident access to a comprehensive package of amenities, including laundry facilities on every floor, bicycle storage, a fitness center, an outdoor recreation deck, outdoor rooftop garden, and community rooms. In addition to much-needed high-quality affordable housing, 425 Grand Concourse provides the community with a 29,000 square-foot City University of New York (CUNY) educational facility, a healthcare facility, a cultural space, a locally-operated supermarket, and a community comfort station.</p>
<p><strong>Full case study available on ULI&#8217;s Knowledge Finder <a href="https://knowledge.uli.org/en/case-studies/2025/425-grand-concourse">here</a>.</strong></p>
<p><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="205" height="300" class="size-medium wp-image-26639 aligncenter" src="https://americas.uli.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/425GrandConcourse-PropertyExterior-CopyrightAlbertVecerka-205x300.jpg" alt="" srcset="https://americas.uli.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/425GrandConcourse-PropertyExterior-CopyrightAlbertVecerka-205x300.jpg 205w, https://americas.uli.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/425GrandConcourse-PropertyExterior-CopyrightAlbertVecerka-699x1024.jpg 699w, https://americas.uli.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/425GrandConcourse-PropertyExterior-CopyrightAlbertVecerka-768x1125.jpg 768w, https://americas.uli.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/425GrandConcourse-PropertyExterior-CopyrightAlbertVecerka-1048x1536.jpg 1048w, https://americas.uli.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/425GrandConcourse-PropertyExterior-CopyrightAlbertVecerka-1398x2048.jpg 1398w, https://americas.uli.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/425GrandConcourse-PropertyExterior-CopyrightAlbertVecerka-57x84.jpg 57w, https://americas.uli.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/425GrandConcourse-PropertyExterior-CopyrightAlbertVecerka-115x168.jpg 115w, https://americas.uli.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/425GrandConcourse-PropertyExterior-CopyrightAlbertVecerka-546x800.jpg 546w, https://americas.uli.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/425GrandConcourse-PropertyExterior-CopyrightAlbertVecerka-410x600.jpg 410w, https://americas.uli.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/425GrandConcourse-PropertyExterior-CopyrightAlbertVecerka-328x480.jpg 328w, https://americas.uli.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/425GrandConcourse-PropertyExterior-CopyrightAlbertVecerka-150x220.jpg 150w, https://americas.uli.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/425GrandConcourse-PropertyExterior-CopyrightAlbertVecerka-55x80.jpg 55w, https://americas.uli.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/425GrandConcourse-PropertyExterior-CopyrightAlbertVecerka-scaled.jpg 1747w" sizes="(max-width: 205px) 100vw, 205px" /></p>
<p><strong>Location: </strong>Bronx, New York<br />
<strong>Developers: </strong>Trinity Financial Inc., MBD Community Housing Corporation</p>

